# CVE allow-list for the release-time Trivy scan (fail on HIGH/CRITICAL).
# One CVE per line with a dated justification; remove when the fix lands.
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # <reason>, expires YYYY-MM-DD

# golang.org/x/net v0.59.0 vendored in MongoDB Database Tools 100.19.1, the
# newest upstream release (mongodump, mongorestore, bsondump). Neither path
# is reachable here: the tools never parse HTML (x/net/html), and they speak
# the Mongo wire protocol, not HTTP/2, to the source. Our own binaries are on
# x/net v0.62.0. Drop these once a mongo-tools release ships x/net >= 0.62.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2027-01-31
CVE-2026-78669 exp:2027-01-31
